WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.800
Hi. I'm Dr. Ted Sun with Transcontinental Education. We're a small business that focuses

00:06.800 --> 00:11.060
on professional development, assessments, and making sure there's accountability to

00:11.060 --> 00:16.360
learning. Something really, really exciting just happened to us. We got our first contract

00:16.360 --> 00:20.960
working with federal government advisors. This is the contract right here, and it's

00:20.960 --> 00:28.400
super exciting because it's worth just around $200,000. And Joe, our writer, was incredibly

00:28.440 --> 00:34.440
detailed. It was a little slow getting started. I started with FGA right around November or

00:34.440 --> 00:39.320
so, and then once we learned how to work the system, getting them the information they

00:39.320 --> 00:45.400
needed to write really effective proposals. So I guess this is the fifth month working

00:45.400 --> 00:50.520
with them. We landed our first major contract. So thank you very much for FGA, especially

00:50.520 --> 00:56.800
to all those that helped us make this happen, and for Joe who made this work extremely

00:56.800 --> 00:57.760
well. Thank you.

